    "# Word2Vec Skip-Gram vs GloVe Study: Word Embeddings Comparison, Visualization, and Evaluation\n",
    "    "    "**Topics:** Word2Vec (Skip-gram) vs. GloVe, Geometric Analysis (PCA vs. t-SNE), Topic Coherence, Centroid Document Embeddings, and Supervised Classification.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### Notebook Architecture & Workflow:\n",
    "1. **Theoretical Foundations:** Deep comparison between predictive (Word2Vec) and count-based log-bilinear matrix factorization (GloVe) models.\n",
    "2. **Dataset Acquisition & Preprocessing:** Loading the Kaggle 5-Domain Text Classification Dataset (`sunilthite/text-document-classification-dataset`), followed by URL/punctuation/digit stripping, tokenization, stopword removal, and WordNet lemmatization (with full theoretical justification over stemming).\n",
    "3. **Word Embedding Implementation:** Training an in-domain 100D Skip-gram model from scratch vs. loading 100D pre-trained GloVe embeddings (`glove-wiki-gigaword-100`).\n",
    "4. **Semantic Similarity & Nearest Neighbors:** 10 domain anchor words, top-5 neighbor retrieval, cosine similarity, syntagmatic vs. paradigmatic relationship analysis, and inter/intra-domain similarity matrices.\n",
    "5. **Dimensionality Reduction & Visualization:** 50 representative domain keywords projected via PCA and t-SNE into a 2x2 comparison grid, coupled with quantitative Topic Coherence evaluation.\n",
    "6. **Downstream Document Classification:** Centroid pooling document vectors, stratified 80/20 split, Logistic Regression vs. Linear SVM evaluation, Classification Reports, and Confusion Matrices.\n",
    "7. **Synthesis & Discussion:** Model verdict, failure analysis, polysemy limitations, pooling loss, and OOV handling."
   ]
