    "## 4. Comparative Analysis & Semantic Similarity\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4.1 Anchor Word Selection & Top-5 Nearest Neighbors\n",
    "To conduct an unbiased evaluation, we select **2 canonical anchor words for each of the 5 domains** (10 anchor words total):\n",
    "- **Politics:** `government`, `minister`\n",
    "- **Sport:** `football`, `champion`\n",
    "- **Tech:** `software`, `computer`\n",
    "- **Entertainment:** `film`, `music`\n",
    "- **Business:** `market`, `economy`\n",
    "\n",
    "For each anchor word $w$, we compute the top-5 nearest neighbors in the embedding space using **Cosine Similarity**:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\text{Cosine Similarity}(u, v) = \\frac{u \\cdot v}{\\|u\\| \\|v\\|} = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^d u_i v_i}{\\sqrt{\\sum_{i=1}^d u_i^2} \\sqrt{\\sum_{i=1}^d v_i^2}}$$"
   ]
