    "### 5.2 Quantitative Topic Coherence Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "To complement qualitative 2D visual inspection, we compute the **Topic Coherence** for each domain. Topic Coherence is quantified as the **mean pairwise cosine similarity** across all keyword pairs within a domain $D_k$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\mathcal{C}(D_k) = \\frac{2}{|D_k|(|D_k|-1)} \\sum_{i=1}^{|D_k|} \\sum_{j=i+1}^{|D_k|} \\cos(v_{w_i}, v_{w_j})$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Higher coherence scores indicate that words within the topic reside tightly together in vector space without semantic dispersion."
   ]
  },
